|i1 : A = {{1,4}, {2,3}}              |
|                                     |
|o1 = {{1, 4}, {2, 3}}                |
|                                     |
|o1 : List                            |
+-------------------------------------+
|i2 : adjoinPurePowers A              |
|                                     |
|o2 = {{5, 0}, {0, 5}, {1, 4}, {2, 3}}|
|                                     |
|o2 : List                            |
+-------------------------------------+

